{"about_the_game":"<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/Action_-_HUD.png?t=1751025633\" /></div><br>Embark on this thrilling journey through pixelated scenarios full of challenges, enemies, and intense action! Alien Strike offers a classic 2D gaming experience, combining elements of action, platforming, and local multiplayer for up to 3 players, all immersed in the vibrant atmosphere of cyberpunk.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/gameplay_3_players_5.gif?t=1751025633\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/Heroes_-_HUD.png?t=1751025633\" /></div><br>Choose from 4 different characters. Master their shooting skills in 8 different directions, slide across the floor, climb cables on the ceiling, and ladders to explore every corner of the environment in a world that evokes the nostalgia of arcade classics.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/Guns_-_HUD.png?t=1751025633\" /></div><br>With the ability to carry up to 2 different weapons, players can customize their approach to combat. Each weapon has an upgraded version that can be unlocked by repeatedly collecting the same type of weapon. Strategy is the key to victory in this futuristic and unforgiving world.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/special_move_-_HUD.png?t=1751025633\" /></div><br>Avoid certain death with strategically placed shield items throughout the map. Additionally, unleash powerful special moves that are charged as you eliminate hordes of enemies, all to the sound of electrifying retrowave-style music, evoking the atmosphere of 80s classics.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/big_Boss_-_HUD.png?t=1751025633\" /></div><br>Get ready to face even bigger challenges at the end of each stage, where giant bosses await to test your skills and strategies. Only the most skilled will survive in this cyberpunk underworld full of action and danger.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/Coop_-_HUD.png?t=1751025633\" /></div><br>Alien Strike offers an engaging experience with local multiplayer. Explore exciting levels and team combat challenges or take on the alien hordes alone, in an epic journey that combines the best of arcade classics.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2876150?t=1751025633","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751025633","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751025633","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751025633","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/Action_-_HUD.png?t=1751025633\" /></div><br>Embark on this thrilling journey through pixelated scenarios full of challenges, enemies, and intense action! Alien Strike offers a classic 2D gaming experience, combining eleme