ategies. Only the most skilled will survive in this cyberpunk underworld full of action and danger.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/Coop_-_HUD.png?t=1751025633\" /></div><br>Alien Strike offers an engaging experience with local multiplayer. Explore exciting levels and team combat challenges or take on the alien hordes alone, in an epic journey that combines the best of arcade classics.","developers":["Combo Game Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/header.jpg?t=1751025633","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257028757,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257028757/movie480.mp4?t=1718039998","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257028757/movie_max.mp4?t=1718039998"},"name":"Trailer 1 - Alien Strike","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257028757/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1718039998","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257028757/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1718039998","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257028757/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1718039998"}}],"name":"Alien Strike: Blasting the Intruders","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD 5000<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Windows compatible sound card</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended: